<codeline lineno="247"><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>evaluate_chebyshev_derivative(x,<sp/>boundsCoeff[0],<sp/>boundsCoeff[1],<sp/>coeff,<sp/>extrapolationTol);</highlight></codeline>
